Error [jet.ImmutableAssignment]: `score` was made with `:`, so it can't be changed
  --> tests/ui/plain_call_changes_colon_binding.jet:17:10
    |
 17 |     bump(score, 1)
    |          ^^^^^
 Why: `bump: fn(n: &Int, by: Int)` changes this input, so `score` must be mutable (`:=`)
 Fix: Declare it with `score := ...`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0111

Error [jet.ImmutableAssignment]: `c` was made with `:`, so it can't be changed
  --> tests/ui/plain_call_changes_colon_binding.jet:19:7
    |
 19 |     c.tick()
    |       ^^^^
 Why: `tick: fn(&self)` changes the value it's called on, so `c` must be mutable (`:=`)
 Fix: Declare it with `c := ...`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0111
